    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1095-a2">

                <pb facs="1173" n="1077" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1077"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 17, from Mr. Finch, see p.
                        —.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Message of condolence from Uruguay.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The minister for foreign affairs has the honor of saluting his excellency the
                    minister plenipotentiary of the United States of North America, and presents in
                    the name of the Uruguayan Government the deepest regret for the catastrophe on
                    board the cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Maine.</hi></p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
